{"campaign_version":"storage-taxonomy-v2-20260813","canonical":{"bri_country":"Yes","category":"综合能源","country":"埃及","country_iso":"EGY","created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:16.542268","excluded":0,"excluded_reason":null,"id":"EGY-HB-0004","ldc":"No","location":"阿斯旺市康翁波地区","location_norm":null,"name_en_quality":"ai_translated","project_name":"埃及康翁波500兆瓦光伏扩建300兆瓦时储能项目","project_name_en":"Egypt Kom Ombo 500MW PV Expansion + 300MWh BESS Project","subcategory":"光储"},"events":[{"articles":[{"author":"西南电力设计院有限公司","content":"近日，中国能建西南院勘察设计的\n埃及首个投产的单体最大储能项目\n康翁波500兆瓦光伏扩建300兆瓦时\n储能项目\n投入商业运行，标志着埃及新能源发展迈入崭新阶段。\n项目概况\n项目位于埃及阿斯旺市康翁波地区，依托已建500兆瓦光伏电站扩建。储能电站容量150兆瓦/300兆瓦时，含72台电池舱、36台PCS一体机及智能控制系统\n。\n建设两点 技术特色\n高效攻坚：2025年6月21日，储能电站6个区域全部实现倒送电，5天内完成热态调试，彰显中国速度。\n技术集成：采用上能电气5兆瓦集中式变流升压一体机与天合光能Elementa液冷储能系统，支持10毫秒级电网切换，精准调控光伏波动。\n电网赋能：通过12回电缆接入原光伏升压站，实现光储协同，提升电网稳定性与消纳能力。\n项目意义\n作为北非首个公用事业级大型储能项目，投产年减排二氧化碳超15万吨，可保障50万户居民稳定用电。项目有效助推埃及可再生能源占比提升，加速“2030可持续能源战略”（目标42%可再生能源）的落地，在为非洲光储融合贡献“中国方案”的同时，也为公司全面提升“四新”核心竞争力、辐射拓展非洲新能源市场提供了坚实的业绩支撑。","content_sha256":"c7c8be64f7bb909b795c985b24616bcacfd0d353d5936e819aed047f59e265c4","id":2995,"publish_date":"2025-07-02 15:20:04","title":"埃及首个单体最大储能项目投运","title_sha256":"96408d0208d0f2504bf312df01cee0b2883c9c966269c40605de3c8e6483dbd2","url":"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/84669.html"}],"event":{"additional_remarks":"","canonical_id":"EGY-HB-0004","capacity_details":"PV: 500MW, BESS: 150MW","capacity_mw":500.0,"capacity_mw_raw":"500","capacity_source":"legacy","contract_amount_usd":null,"contract_amount_usd_raw":null,"created_at":"2026-03-23T09:49:16.542541","financing_amount_usd":null,"financing_amount_usd_raw":null,"financing_model":"Unknown","financing_model_details":"","id":"EGY-HB-0004-01","investment_date":"","line_length_km":null,"needs_manual_review":0,"non_official_website_links":"[]","official_website_links":"[\"http://www.swepdi.ceec.net.cn/art/2025/5/28/art_58757_2519882.html\"]","planned_complete_date":"","planned_start_date":"","production_capacity_unit":null,"production_capacity_value":null,"project_developer":"Unknown","project_developer_en":null,"project_stage":"投入运营","project_summary":"中国能建西南院在中国埃及合作框架下，为埃及设计并投运了康翁波500兆瓦光伏扩建300兆瓦时储能项目。该项目是埃及首个单体最大储能项目，已投入商业运行，显著提升了埃及新能源发展水平。","publish_date":"2025-07-02 15:20:04","pv_capacity_mw":500.0,"source_links":"[\"https://news.goalfore.cn/topstories/detail/84669.html\"]","storage_energy_mwh":null,"storage_power_mw":150.0,"total_investment_usd":null,"total_investment_usd_raw":"","transmission_capacity_mw":null,"verification_confidence":null,"verification_sources":null,"verification_status":"unverified","voltage_kv":null}}],"evidence_policy":{"exact_quote_required":true,"quote_must_not_cross_surfaces":true,"valid_surfaces":["title","body"]},"project_id":"EGY-HB-0004","schema_version":"storage-taxonomy-evidence-package-v1","selection_reasons":["active_hybrid_category","existing_storage_numeric","storage_text_signal"]}
